  "description": "And if your Thrill finds you\non Blueberry Hill, you'll get to the top using Shimano's 8-speed shifting\nsystem and nail the descent in comfort and control with SunTour's Magnesium\nMG-60 suspension fork and ProMax mechanical disc brakes.\n\nYou'll be hard pressed to find another disc-brake equipped 8-speed mountain\nbike for five big ones anywhere else-especially one with a Fuji pedigree\nthat's been assembled in a real bike store by an experienced professional\nmechanic. No matter how good the quality, a mountain bike won't stand\na chance of lasting multiple seasons if it's slapped together by some\nunskilled kid with a dull screwdriver and a pair of pliers.\n\nThe Pro-Max discs are cable actuated and feature adjustable alignment\nfor many miles of drag-free off-road fun.",
